25Prepare as-built documentation                                          000830
26   Prepare as-built documents of all work executed on the               000831
26   basis of the updated execution design.                               000832
26   The AN has to continuously survey digitally the lines                000833
26   and structures laid and those found in the course of                 000834
26   the digging work. The necessary surveying work as well               000835
26   as on-site measurements are to be included in the price              000836
26   and are not paid separately.                                         000837
26   The drawing documents must be prepared in digital form               000838
26   and marked as [PERSON_0118], contain the scale and, if               000839
26   applicable, be provided with a revision note.                        000840
26                                                                        000841
26   The following contents must be shown:                                000842
26   - Position and level of the structures constructed                   000843
26   - Line plan including                                                000844
26   nominal diameters, gradient profile, invert levels                   000845
26   - Invert and cover levels of the shaft structures                    000846
26   - Finished levels                                                    000847
26   - the indication of all built-in components in the UTM               000848
26   coordinate system with indication of the coordinates                 000849
26   for position and level                                               000850
26                                                                        000851
26   Furthermore, all technical drawings or detail drawings               000852
26   used are to be handed over.                                          000853
26                                                                        000854
26   When incorporating and preparing the [PERSON_0118] the               000855
26   layer structures acc. to the design handed over by the               000856
26   AG are to be retained.                                               000857
26   Structure of the as-built documentation:                             000858
26   - Table of contents                                                  000859
26   - [PERSON_0118]                                                      000860
26   - Layer list                                                         000861
26   - List with assignment of the line colours to the line               000862
26   widths                                                               000863
26                                                                        000864
26   The design is made available to the AN for further                   000865
26   processing as                                                        000866
26   CAD file in DWG format.                                              000867
26                                                                        000868
26   The as-built documents are to be handed over to the AG               000869
26   2 weeks before acceptance digitally for checking on CD               000870
26   - 2 copies:                                                          000871
26                                                                        000872
26   CAD drawing in DWG or DXF format                                     000873
26   other drawing documents in format PDF format                         000874
26                                                                        000875
26   The data carrier is to be labelled with the following                000876
26   details:                                                             000877
26   - Project name                                                       000878
26   - Client                                                             000879
26   - Content of the documentation                                       000880
26   - Date of preparation of the documentation                           000881
26   - Author of the doocumentation / name of the AN                      000882
