12Civil works-[PERSON_132] [PERSON_151]. East -                           000907
20                                                                        000908
26   Low-vibration construction equipment, excitation                     000909
26   frequency > 40 Hz, poss. restrictions                                000910
26                                                                        000911
26                                                                        000912
26   Sensitive facilities in the surroundings of the site,                000913
26   possible restrictions                                                000914
26   Between central workshop and Immerwahrstra·e there is                000915
26   the institute building "IZNF".                                       000916
26   On the ground floor and partly in the basement of this               000917
26   building, on the north side, measuring rooms with                    000918
26   highly sensitive measuring instruments and microscopes               000919
26   are set up, with which experiments are carried out that              000920
26   tolerate no vibrations.                                              000921
26   For this reason, for compaction work, compaction                     000922
26   equipment is in principle to be used that works with                 000923
26   low vibration because of Its vibration frequency;                    000924
26   excitation frequency > 40 Hz.                                        000925
26   Before the start of the construction project a                       000926
26   construction schedule is to be prepared by the AN, from              000927
26   which the approximate times for the vibration-prone                  000928
26   work can be seen.                                                    000929
26   On the basis of this construction schedule,                          000930
26   coordination is then carried out with the responsible                000931
26   supervisor of the measuring facilities in the IZNF, in               000932
26   order to fix a time schedule acceptable to all sides                 000933
26   for vibration-free times and times in which                          000934
26   vibration-prone work can be executed. The                            000935
26   vibration-prone work is therefore to be announced with               000936
26   a lead time of at least 2 weeks to the IZNF, via the                 000937
26   FIR001 and the construction supervision. The                         000938
26   vibration-prone construction work so far in the                      000939
26   immediate surroundings of the IZNF could, according to               000940
26   experience, after coordination, be executed without                  000941
26   problems.                                                            000942
