20                                                                        002030
26   Low-vibration construction equipment, excitation                     002031
26   frequency > 40 Hz, poss. restrictions                                002032
26                                                                        002033
26                                                                        002034
26   Sensitive facilities in the surroundings of the site,                002035
26   possible restrictions                                                002036
26   Between central workshop and Immerwahrstra·e there is                002037
26   the institute building "IZNF".                                       002038
26   On the ground floor and partly in the basement of this               002039
26   building, on the north side, measuring rooms with                    002040
26   highly sensitive measuring instruments and microscopes               002041
26   are set up, with which experiments are carried out that              002042
26   tolerate no vibrations.                                              002043
26   For this reason, for compaction work, compaction                     002044
26   equipment is in principle to be used that works with                 002045
26   low vibration because of Its vibration frequency;                    002046
26   excitation frequency > 40 Hz.                                        002047
26   Before the start of the construction project a                       002048
26   construction schedule is to be prepared by the AN, from              002049
26   which the approximate times for the vibration-prone                  002050
26   work can be seen.                                                    002051
26   On the basis of this construction schedule,                          002052
26   coordination is then carried out with the responsible                002053
26   supervisor of the measuring facilities in the IZNF, in               002054
26   order to fix a time schedule acceptable to all sides                 002055
26   for vibration-free times and times in which                          002056
26   vibration-prone work can be executed. The                            002057
26   vibration-prone work is therefore to be announced with               002058
26   a lead time of at least 2 weeks to the IZNF, via the                 002059
26   FIR001 and the construction supervision. The                         002060
26   vibration-prone construction work so far in the                      002061
26   immediate surroundings of the IZNF could, according to               002062
26   experience, after coordination, be executed without                  002063
26   problems.                                                            002064
