26   They include:                                                        002790
26   - wage and salary costs,                                             002791
26   - ancillary wage and salary costs,                                   002792
26   - social costs including social fund contributions,                  002793
26   - shares of overheads,                                               002794
26   - profit.                                                            002795
26   Surcharges on the charge-out rates for night, Sunday,                002796
26   public holiday and additional work (overtime) ordered                002797
26   by the client or for which the client is responsible                 002798
26   are to be proven separately; they are paid in the                    002799
26   amount of the collective agreement.                                  002800
26   For night, Sunday and public holiday work, only the                  002801
26   contribution to statutory accident insurance is paid as              002802
26   a surcharge. For additional work, the social costs are               002803
26   paid in addition.                                                    002804
26   If the bidder does not employ any workers in one of the              002805
26   following wage/occupational groups, he has to state                  002806
26   this and instead offer the use of workers as equivalent              002807
26   as possible.                                                         002808
